Last night, the weather in Mumbai changed.
The first pre-monsoon rain happened.
The intense heat of the city has reduced.
Today morning's air is very cool.
I wake up from sleep.
But today I am not feeling well at all.
My health is not fine.
My head is feeling very heavy.
There is a sharp pain in my head.
My nose is also completely blocked.
There is pain in the throat too.
I am having a little trouble breathing.
There is pain in my whole body.
Perhaps I have caught a cold from the changing weather.
I slowly get up from the bed.
I go to the kitchen and warm some water to drink.
Today is an office day.
But I cannot go to the office by bus in this condition.
Today I should stay at home.
I should go to the doctor and rest.
